">`, and :doc:`Windows </user/templates/windows/index>`"
msgstr ""
"同時使用多個作業系統，包括 :doc:`Fedora </user/templates/fedora/fedora>`、:"
"doc:`Debian </user/templates/debian/debian/>` 以及 :doc:`Windows </user/"
"templates/windows/index>`"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:43 ec56a7713b4c4eb5938477b2e5e24764
msgid ":term:`Disposables <disposable>`"
msgstr ":term:`可拋棄式 qube <disposable>`"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:44 3457af5196ca43ce8acac5a6b45d834c
msgid ""
"Create :doc:`disposables </user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-disposables>` on "
